# The monorepo root ignores *.pdf and *.png globally to keep experiment artefacts
# out of git. This report's compiled PDF and its vector figures are the
# deliverable, so re-include them here. The PNGs beside the figures are throwaway
# previews for an image viewer.
!*.pdf
figures/*.png

# LaTeX build intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
